Route optimisation to reduce travel time between stops.
Automatic reassignment if a zone exceeds workload capacity.
Customer notifications for slot confirmation and delays."
Inputs Required:

Number of delivery vehicles & capacity
City map with delivery zones
Order inflow pattern by hour
Cut-off time for same-day delivery
Real-time order data feed

